      <h1 class="page-title">A builder's notes, kept at the smallest node.</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">
        I am a student in a community-college transfer pathway toward a four-year engineering
        degree, intending electrical or computer engineering. I work across hardware, software,
        and systems. The work starts from a failure I can see and touch, not from a thesis about
        the future.
      </p>
